Coder: read /06/handoff.md, /06/01/inventory.md, /06/02/architecture.md, and /06/03/migration-ledger.md. Establish one owner of active selector kind/view, common selection/filter state, and open/replace/close transitions. Expose narrow feature interfaces rather than independently mutable fields; compiling consumer stubs are allowed. Record actual interfaces, ownership, stub consumers, and build evidence in /06/03/migration-ledger.md for subsequent feature goals. Compilation, not UI behavior, is the gate.
